[[2047,127,0,"<aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000166.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Follow security regulations prescribed\n(see 5040A - Warnings).</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside>"],[22,127,16,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Position the car on the lift.</p><p>Drain the coolant. \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238305\">5040A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238429\">5530B10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238435\">5530B52</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237525\">1048A10</a></p><p>1. Loosen the clamps.</p><p>2. Remove the air pipe from throttle casing air filter.</p><p>3. Unscrew the screw.</p><p>4. Disconnect the unions (4a) and keep the bushing (4b).</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/769.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000041.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Plug the disconnected unions properly\nin order to prevent humidity and dirt from entering the system.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><p>5. Unscrew the union fastening nut.</p><p>6. Release the clamps.</p><p>7. Remove the pipe.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2018464.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[22,127,16,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the pipe is not damaged or slitted.</p><p>Reposition the pipe fastening it with the\nclamps.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/769.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000041.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Replace union O-rings.</p><p>Use\nR134A coolantproof green rings only.</p><p>Lubrificate union threads\nwith antifreezing oil.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><p>Reposition the bushing, connect the evaporator\nunion and fasten it with the screw.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>Evaporator connector</p></td><td><p>M6</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>0.9 - 1.2</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Lift the car, connect the intermediate\nunion and block it with the nut.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Nut</p></td><td><p>Intermediate connector</p></td><td><p>M6</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>0.9 - 1.2</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Reassemble the air pipe throttle casing\nair filter.</p><p><a href=\"#/3237525\">1048A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238435\">5530B52</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238429\">5530B10</a></p><p>Reload the coolant. \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238305\">5040A10</a></p><p>Remove the car from  the lift.</p>"],[2047,127,0,"<aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000166.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Respect safety regulations prescribed\n(see 5040A - Warnings).</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside>"],[576,127,16,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Position the car on the lift.</p><p>Drain the coolant. \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238305\">5040A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238429\">5530B10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238435\">5530B52</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237525\">1048A10</a></p><p>1. Loosen the clamps.</p><p>2. remove the air pipe from multistage centrifugal blower to intercooler.</p><p>3. Unscrew the union fastening nut.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/769.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000041.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Plug the disconnected unions properly\nin order to prevent humidity and dirt from entering the system.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><p>4. Lower the car and unscrew the power steering fluid reservoir.</p><p>5. Move the power steering fluid reservoir .</p><p>6. Unscrew the screw.</p><p>7. Disconnect unions (7a) and keep the bushing (7b).</p><p>8. Release the clamps.</p><p>9. Remove the pipe.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2018465.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[576,127,16,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the pipe is not damaged or slitted.</p><p>Reposition the pipe fastening it with clamps.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/769.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000041.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Replace union O-rings.</p><p>Use\nR134A coolantproof green rings only.</p><p>Lubricate union threads\nwith antifreezing oil.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><p>Reposition the bushing, connect the evaporator\nunit and block it with the screw.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>Evaporator connector</p></td><td><p>M6</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>0.9 - 1.2</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Position the power steering fluid reservoir\nand fasten it with screws.</p><p>Lift the car, connect the intermediate\nunion and block it with the nut.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Nut</p></td><td><p>Intermediate connector</p></td><td><p>M6</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>0.9 - 1.2</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Reassemble the air pipe from multistage\ncentrifugal power to intercooler.</p><p>Fasten the clamps.</p><p><a href=\"#/3237525\">1048A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238435\">5530B52</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238429\">5530B10</a></p><p>Reload the coolant. \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238305\">5040A10</a></p><p>Remove the car from the lift.</p>"]]